# Guildhouse lets a green legendary creature band with another legendary creature; blocking one blocks both, and their controller assigns damage (CR 702.22c, 702.22h, 702.22k).
[Bot1 Deck]
Adventurers' Guildhouse
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Reptil, Dinomorpher
Isamaru, Hound of Konda
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Black Lotus
Ulvenwald Oddity
Island x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Adventurers' Guildhouse.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Reptil, Dinomorpher.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Isamaru, Hound of Konda.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Ulvenwald Oddity.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Reptil, Dinomorpher > Bot2; Isamaru, Hound of Konda > Bot2)
Bot1.Choose(Isamaru, Hound of Konda)
? Combat.Attackers = Reptil, Dinomorpher > Bot2 (band 1); Isamaru, Hound of Konda > Bot2 (band 1)
Bot2.Block(Ulvenwald Oddity > Reptil, Dinomorpher)
[T3 Bot1.Blockers]
? Combat.Blocks = Ulvenwald Oddity > Reptil, Dinomorpher; Ulvenwald Oddity > Isamaru, Hound of Konda
Bot1.AssignDamage(Ulvenwald Oddity > Reptil, Dinomorpher: 4)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard.Reptil, Dinomorpher.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Isamaru, Hound of Konda.Damage = 0
Bot2.Life = 20
